"""Template for a new game driver. Copy to `drivers/<yourgame>.py` and implement.

Nothing else needs touching — `registry.discover()` imports every module in this
folder at startup, the `@registry.register` decorator puts the driver in the
list, and `/modsettings драйвер:<id>` starts using it for /mutegame.

Config for the driver arrives as `self.config` (the `drivers.<id>` object in
config.json), the case store as `self.db`.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

